## Project Description
This project was developed using OpenGL and GLUT in C++.

The project renders:
- Pepsi Logo
- European Union (EU) Flag

The project demonstrates computer graphics concepts such as:
- Basic primitives
- RGB color handling
- 2D transformations
- Animation

---

## Features
- Points
- Lines
- Polygons
- RGB Colors
- Translation
- Rotation
- Scaling
- Animation (Bonus Feature)

---

## Technologies Used
- C++
- OpenGL
- GLUT

