## How to Run
1. Open the project in CodeBlocks or Visual Studio
2. Build the project
3. Run the executable

---

## Transformations Used

### Translation
Used to move the logo position.

### Rotation
Used to rotate the Pepsi logo.

### Scaling
Used to resize the logo.

---

## Bonus Feature
Animation was implemented using timer functions to continuously rotate the Pepsi logo.

